      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so my left calf has been super swollen and kinda sore for like two days now. i think i just pulled a muscle or something but now i'm feeling really short of breath and my chest feels a bit tight. do u think this is just anxiety from work being crazy lately? i've been pretty stressed.",
