      "content": "urgency makes me so anxious though... i hate hospitals. honestly the tightness doesn't even feel like pain, it just feels like im not getting enough air because im so worked up. could it just be a panic attack? i have some leftover diazepam from a few years ago, would taking one of those help me calm down and sleep it off?",
